  WrittenDialogue: "Oh hey, Nicole. You doin’ these puzzles too?\nOh my god, you’re doing this shit?\nI think everybody is honestly, but it’s still cool that you’re doing it.\nYeah I’m sure.\nYeah the guy um,{1.2} he like said there was a prize?\n...Uh huh.\nWhat do you want the prize to be?\nYou to fuck off and die.\nNo seriously.\nYeah I was just joking I meant everybody to fuck off and die.\nWell y’know whatever it is I hope it’s just chill.\nHow do you never shut up while also saying absolutely nothing?\nBut honestly, I hope the prize is just hanging out with you.. As a friend.. Though.\nWow really just me?\nTotally! I haven’t said that to anyone else.\nYeah cause I’m probably the first bitch you’re lying to.\nSo you wanna try like..{1.1} Playing this puzzle thing?\nIf I beat you will you fuck off to your basket of guitar picks?\nOh you like guitar too?\nWhy are you trying to extend this conversation?\nSorry no I get it, cause like talking is hard cause of trauma.\nYeah trauma from you.\nWell if I win can we talk a little more?\nI’ve never been so motivated to solve a puzzle."
  DialogueCharacterNames: "CRISPIN\nNICOLE\nCRISPIN\nNICOLE\nCRISPIN\nNICOLE\nCRISPIN\nNICOLE\nCRISPIN\nNICOLE\nCRISPIN\nNICOLE\nCRISPIN\nNICOLE\nCRISPIN\nNICOLE\nCRISPIN\nNICOLE\nCRISPIN\nNICOLE\nCRISPIN\nNICOLE\nCRISPIN\nNICOLE"
